---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import { sitePath } from "../lib/paths";
---

<!-- prettier-ignore -->
<p>I'm a software engineering student at <span class="keep"><Icon name="gdut" /><strong>GDUT</strong></span>, formerly a backend intern at <span class="keep"><Icon name="dify" /><strong>LangGenius</strong></span>.</p>
<!-- prettier-ignore -->
<p>I build backend systems and developer tools, mostly in <span class="keep"><Icon name="go" /><strong>Go</strong></span> and <span class="keep"><Icon name="typescript" /><strong>TypeScript</strong></span>. I enjoy turning complex problems into simple, maintainable solutions.</p>
<!-- prettier-ignore -->
<p>For infrastructure, I lean on <span class="keep"><Icon name="kubernetes" /><strong>Kubernetes</strong></span>, <span class="keep"><Icon name="docker" /><strong>Docker</strong></span>, and <span class="keep"><Icon name="opentelemetry" /><strong>OpenTelemetry</strong></span>, focusing on cloud-native platforms, distributed systems, and observability.</p>
<!-- prettier-ignore -->
<p>Recently, I've been exploring agent systems and the infrastructure behind them. I'm also interested in the web, product design, and the little details that make software worth using.<span
    class="meme"
    tabindex="0"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Meme: a cream cat peeking around a corner"
  ><img
      class="meme-thumb"
      src={sitePath("meme.gif")}
      alt=""
      width="18"
      height="18"
      decoding="async"
    /><span class="meme-pop" aria-hidden="true"><img
        src={sitePath("meme.gif")}
        alt=""
        width="168"
        height="168"
        decoding="async"
      /></span></span></p>
<!-- prettier-ignore -->
<p>Always happy to connect over interesting projects and ideas. Reach me at <span class="keep"><Icon name="email" /><a href="mailto:l1nsn0w@qq.com">l1nsn0w@qq.com</a></span>.</p>
